    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
      children: ["Applying the Pareto principle to FastAPI reveals that roughly 20% of the framework's features deliver 80% of the value for most projects. Mastering these core concepts enables you to build production-ready APIs without drowning in advanced features you may never need. The first critical element is understanding path operation decorators (", _jsx(_components.code, {
